{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cubic Cosmos combines roguelike deck building with fast-paced tower defense gameplay. Build an unstoppable army of pawns, chain together massive combos, and enjoy endless possibilities!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mix and Match Countless Exciting Strategies</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create an army of unstoppable pawns and build up their attributes to beat down the strongest of bosses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332600/extras/c9f436dbf0a397d6fddc57953b1ab95e.poster.avif?t=1759031098\" width=1170 height=662 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332600/extras/c9f436dbf0a397d6fddc57953b1ab95e.webm?t=1759031098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332600/extras/c9f436dbf0a397d6fddc57953b1ab95e.mp4?t=1759031098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain together abilities to unleash awesome combos, take endless turns, and deal massive damage... anything is possible!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up pawns to unlock incredible synergies and clear whole battlefields in a single shot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332600/extras/fd83c3e237d8afd4c6695702f0c2bfd9.poster.avif?t=1759031098\" width=800 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332600/extras/fd83c3e237d8afd4c6695702f0c2bfd9.webm?t=1759031098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332600/extras/fd83c3e237d8afd4c6695702f0c2bfd9.mp4?t=1759031098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build an Unbeatable Deck</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine cards and Relics to build an unstoppable deck.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 200+ cards, create lethal combinations that are unique to you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore unique effect combos with 40+ equippable Relics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear runs to unlock 9 different heroes with unique abilities.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of random events make each run a new adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332600/extras/65dbac2d4072fa20062900f2cf68b4e7.poster.avif?t=1759031098\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332600/extras/65dbac2d4072fa20062900f2cf68b4e7.webm?t=1759031098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332600/extras/65dbac2d4072fa20062900f2cf68b4e7.mp4?t=1759031098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rise to the Challenge in Multiple Game Modes</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless Adventures: With fixed and random boss fights and daily challenges, you'll find new thrills in every run!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scaling Difficulty: Prove yourself in 10+ difficulty levels and emerge stronger than ever.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mastery Mode: Are you a true master of the cosmos? Put your perfectly crafted deck to the test in this high-pressure game mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinl